  "rationale": "This batch exercises several contract clauses and partitions that were not covered by the current suite or prior proposals: (1) Ambiguous string concatenation collisions where tenant and key share a delimiter ('alpha_1' / '2' vs 'alpha' / '1_2'); (2) Float quantities (e.g. 1.0), missing required fields across reserve/release/stock, and unknown op rejection; (3) Exact boundary quantity of 10 exhausting stock to 0 followed by insufficient check and restoration; (4) Payload conflict detection persisting even after a key is released, ensuring released keys cannot be repurposed with different sku/qty; (5) Reservation retry succeeding on keys that previously failed input validation; (6) Validation of sku on stock queries and default 10-unit initialization for untouched tenants; and (7) Guaranteeing that an intervening conflict attempt does not corrupt the active reservation lifecycle or release behavior.",
